    LLM: '1. Deal 9. 2. Bid (Normal, Vuelta, Solo). Highest bid becomes Declarer. 3. Declarer discards and draws from stock. Opponents may also draw. 4. Play 9 tricks. Follow suit. Trumps beat plain. 5. Declarer wins if taking 5+ tricks (against 2 opponents).',
